hat could jeopardise long\u2011distance cockpit dynamics.\n**Recommendation (provisional):** Candidate\u202fC is the strongest overall fit at this stage. We should still obtain missing observations on stress resilience for Candidate\u202fC (and D) and reliability/crew cooperation for Candidates\u202fA and\u202fD before finalising the decision."}
